containers‐storage      set‐names      [‐n      name       [...]]
layerOrImageOrContainerNameOrID

In  addition  to  IDs,  layers,  images,  and containers can have
human‐readable names assigned to them in containers‐storage.  The
set‐names command can be used to reset the list of names for  any
‐n | ‐‐name name
